{
  "html": [
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Style emerges from consistency, and having a style opens your imagination. Your mind should be flexible, but your process should be repeatable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "A style can be a system, a pattern, a set of personal guidelines. Here are a few of mine:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "ul",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "I wear monochromatic clothing without logos"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "I use a specific date format everywhere"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "I pluralize tag and folder names (e.g. groups not group)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "I use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "https://content-patterns--content-list-with-internal-links/plain-text"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "plain text files"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " for all my writing"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "I ask myself "
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "https://content-patterns--content-list-with-internal-links/annual-review"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "reflection questions every year"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "I meal prep lunches every week, and exercise twice a week"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "I write "
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "https://content-patterns--content-list-with-internal-links/brevity"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "short essays"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": ", less than 500 words"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Collect constraints you enjoy. Unusual constraints make things more fun. You can always change them later."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Having a style collapses hundreds of future decisions into one, and gives you focus."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
